    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d255">

                <pb facs="0365" n="345" sameAs="frus:frus1950v07/pg345"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">795.00/7–1050: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Douglas</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">top secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1950-07-10T13:00:00+01:00">July 10, 1950—1 p.
                            m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received July 10—2:03 p. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>175. Eyes only for the Secretary. Re Deptel 123, July 9. Discussed with Prime
                    Minister four points suggested in reftel. He indicated complete approval but
                    asked that matter be discussed detail with Strang who at that time had been sent
                    out to see Bevin at the hospital.</p>
                <p>Will see Strang soon as he returns.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d255-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>Department pass Moscow. Repeated information Moscow 12, eyes only for
                    Ambassador.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Douglas</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
